  "prefLabel": "Jus 604.09 Verification of Funeral/Burial Expenses Form",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-09-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 604.09 Verification of Funeral/Burial Expenses Form. If a claimant seeks compensation for funeral/burial expenses, the victims’ assistance unit shall request from each person who provided services for which compensation is sought that they complete and submit a “Verification of Funeral/Burial Expenses Form,” as revised 8/23/19. In addition to completing the form, each person who provided services shall include an itemized statement of services.\n\nSource. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19 (formerly Jus 604.09)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus600.html"
